{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09106","headline":"赠李判官 · 韦应物","name":"赠李判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"良玉定爲宝，长材世所稀。\n佐幕方巡郡，奏命布恩威。\n食蔬程独守，饮冰节靡违。\n决狱兴邦颂，高文禀天机。\n宾馆在林表，望山啓西扉。\n下有千亩田，泱漭吴土肥。\n始耕已见获，袗絺今授衣。\n政拙劳详省，淹留未得归。\n虽慙且忻愿，日夕覩光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09106.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09106","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}